@startuml context
' Business-level state machine: what a search *is* at each moment, and the
' operations that move it forward.
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F2F2F2
  BorderColor #666666
  FontColor #222222
  ArrowColor #333333
}

[*] --> ENDPOINT_UNDECLARED

ENDPOINT_UNDECLARED --> ENDPOINT_READY       : declareEndpoint()
ENDPOINT_READY      --> ENDPOINT_UNDECLARED  : retireEndpoint()

ENDPOINT_READY      --> REQUEST_RECEIVED     : receiveRequest()
REQUEST_RECEIVED    --> REQUEST_INTERPRETED  : interpretRequest()
REQUEST_INTERPRETED --> REQUEST_VALIDATED    : validateFields()
REQUEST_VALIDATED   --> REQUEST_AUTHORISED   : enforcePolicy()
REQUEST_AUTHORISED  --> PLAN_READY           : buildPlan()

PLAN_READY          --> PLAN_READY           : rememberPlan()
ENDPOINT_READY      --> PLAN_READY           : reusePlan()

PLAN_READY          --> RESULT_READY         : searchRecords()
PLAN_READY          --> RESULT_READY         : countMatches()
PLAN_READY          --> RESULT_READY         : summariseValues()
PLAN_READY          --> RESULT_READY         : groupResults()

RESULT_READY        --> PAGE_READY           : paginateResults()
PAGE_READY          --> ANSWER_FORMATTED     : chooseFormat()
ANSWER_FORMATTED    --> ENDPOINT_READY       : deliverAnswer()

REQUEST_INTERPRETED --> REQUEST_REJECTED     : rejectRequest()
REQUEST_VALIDATED   --> REQUEST_REJECTED     : rejectRequest()
REQUEST_AUTHORISED  --> REQUEST_REJECTED     : denyAccess()
REQUEST_REJECTED    --> ENDPOINT_READY       : reportError()

ENDPOINT_UNDECLARED --> [*]

note bottom of REQUEST_REJECTED
  Nothing is queried until it has been
  validated and authorised.
end note
@enduml
